  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Streaming correctness: a consuming expression placed directly in a streamable xsl:source-document body or a streamable xsl:template match=\"/\" now produces correct output across xsl:try, xsl:fork, xsl:iterate, xsl:for-each-group, the aggregation/higher-order functions (fold-left/right, sum/count/avg/max/min, boolean/not/exists/empty, one-or-more and friends), and expression operators (treat as, instance of, union/except/intersect, sequence, square-array constructor) — these document-level constructs previously evaluated against an empty input and returned empty or seed-only results. Also fixes intermediate-step predicates in streaming aggregation (a predicate on an ancestor step is now applied) and an xsl:for-each whose select ends in a copy-of()/snapshot() step. Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.9 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.6. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
